            "review_title": "Review at Anh Tuyet",
            "review_text": "Missy Santos\n12 contributions\n0\nBest Chicken 👍\nJan 2018 • Family\nMadam Tuyet is the epitome of Hanoi’s culinary arts and hospitality at its finest. Located in a quiet and unassuming spot in Old Quarter. Tried the special set menu and here are my favorites: Had pho in a couple of places and this was the best we tried. Spring rolls were very light, balanced and flavorful. Heard a lot of hype about the honey chicken and it did not disappoint! Haven’t had chicken like that anywhere! It’s really what makes this place special. The sauce and the side salad go perfectly with it. Don’t leave Hanoi without having the chicken. Get help from your concierge to make reservations (English is a challenge.)\nRead more\nWritten January 3, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
