            "review_text": "DUSTY B\nST. JOHN'S251 contributions\n0\nÁNH TUYÉT RESTAURANT\nOct 2017 • Couples\nA hidden gem. This restaurant does not jump out at you with any neon signs and such. You have to search it out. The food is excellent, based on authentic traditional regional cuisine. It has received numerous accolades from Vietnamese restaurant reviewers and others, including celebrity chef, Anthony Bourdain. For my partner and I, we were treated to shopping with the chef at Hanoi's old quarter neighbourhood food markets, preparing the meal under her expert supervision and savouring the results of our labours.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 11, 2017",
