            "review_text": "Wadstorm\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam73 contributions\n0\nLost its charm\nAug 2017 • Couples\nI came here many years ago and had the best chicken I had ever eaten. After seeing it on Anthony Bourdain's show, I was fortunate to come and try the chicken cooked by madam Tuyet herself. \nUnfortunately now the charm has gone. It's still run by the Tuyet family but clearly the desire to be the best is not as important now and the restaurant is empty. Such a pity. I hope they read trip advisor and take this as constructive feedback. The same chicken I ordered years ago that I have told so many people was the best ever is now just ok.\nRead more\nWritten August 28, 2017",
