            "review_title": "Review at Anh Tuyet",
            "review_text": "AdobeSusan\nSANTA FE29 contributions\n0\nCooking class for good beginnings\nFeb 2017 • Couples\nHad a lovely experience shopping for ingredients in the street markets and going to Anh Tuyet restaurant to prepare a few basic dishes...fried spring rolls with dipping sauce, steamed snakehead fish with mushrooms and banana blossom and papaya salad.\n\nAfter told to wash hands, we began instruction on making our dishes and also learned about homeopathic qualities of the various ingredients. All very interesting.\n\nAs we understood it, our instructor, Trang, was the daughter of Madame Tuyet and so pleasant. Ran into her again on the street a few days later and she greeted us very warmly.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 14, 2017",
